  "读经和祷告的格子只是提醒自己有没有持续，不是成绩；断了接着来就好。屏幕时长越少越好，其余越多越好；箭头和上一段同样长的时间比。": "The Bible and prayer squares are a reminder of continuity, not a score; if you break a streak, just continue. Less screen time is better, more of everything else; arrows compare with the previous period of the same length.",
