  "{n} 段": "{n} sessions", "一键起步会建立：读经、祷告、锻炼（每周 3 次）、屏幕时长、健康饮食、专注，之后随时改。": "Quick start creates: Bible, prayer, exercise (3× a week), screen time, healthy eating and focus; change them any time.", "专注": "Focus", "专注完成，休息 {n} 分钟": "Focus done, rest {n} min", "专注计时": "Focus timer", "中途被打断就点“结束”，超过 1 分钟的部分照样记下来，不必从头来过。": "Interrupted? Tap Stop; anything over a minute is still logged, no need to start over.", "今天 {n} 段 · {m} 分钟": "{n} sessions · {m} min today", "今天这轮已完成 {n} 段": "{n} sessions done this round", "休息": "Break", "休息完等我点": "Wait for me after a break", "休息完自动开始下一段": "Auto-start after a break", "休息结束": "Break over", "先从 25 分钟开始，一周里大多数天都能完成 4 段，再加到 30、45 分钟。": "Start with 25 minutes; once most days of a week reach 4 sessions, move to 30 or 45.", "关": "Off", "准备": "Ready", "准备好了就开始下一段": "Start the next session when ready", "回顾页能看到每天的段数和分钟，连续几天稳定了再加长。": "Review shows sessions and minutes per day; lengthen only after a few steady days.", "在做什么（可空）": "What are you working on (optional)", "声音关": "Sound off", "声音开": "Sound on", "好了，继续": "Done, continue", "已暂停": "Paused", "开": "On", "开始": "Start", "开始下一段": "Start next session", "开始专注": "Start focusing", "开始前写一句“在做什么”，一段只做这一件事；手机放到另一个房间。": "Write what you're doing before you start; one thing per session; phone in another room.", "怎么练专注": "Training focus", "护眼": "Eye rest", "护眼 {n} 次": "{n} eye rests", "护眼按 20-20-20 法则：每 20 分钟看 6 米（20 英尺）以外 20 秒，专注时间顺延。页面要保持打开（可以切到别的标签页，标题会显示倒计时）；手机锁屏后计时继续，但提示音要回到页面才响。": "Eye rest follows the 20-20-20 rule: every 20 minutes look 20 feet (6 m) away for 20 seconds; focus time is extended. Keep the page open (another tab is fine; the title shows the countdown). On a locked phone the timer keeps counting but the sound plays once you return.", "提醒": "Alerts", "放松眼睛，看 6 米以外的东西": "Relax your eyes; look at something 20 feet away", "暂停": "Pause", "桌面通知": "Desktop notifications", "桌面通知已开启": "Desktop notifications on", "段": "sessions", "每": "every", "每天 {n} 段": "{n} sessions a day", "每天几段（专注计时器自动记录，这里只是目标）": "Sessions a day (the timer logs them; this is just the goal)", "没登录，这段专注没有记录": "Not signed in, so this session was not logged", "浏览器没有允许通知": "The browser did not allow notifications", "清零": "Reset count", "番茄工作法，每 20 分钟提醒看远处 20 秒护眼；完成的段自动记录": "Pomodoro timer with a 20-second eye rest every 20 minutes; finished sessions are logged", "登录后完成的段会自动记录。": "Sign in and finished sessions are logged automatically.", "看远处": "Look far away", "看远处 {n} 秒": "Look far away for {n} s", "眨眨眼，看 6 米以外的东西，让眼睛松一松": "Blink, look at something 20 feet away, let your eyes rest", "秒": "s", "第 {n} 段": "Session {n}", "第 {n} 段 · 离开屏幕几分钟": "Session {n} · step away from the screen", "第 {n} 段 · 长休息：起来走走、喝口水": "Session {n} · long break: walk around, drink water", "结束": "Stop", "继续": "Resume", "跳过休息": "Skip break", "还没有“专注”习惯：完成的段会记在自动创建的一项上，可在回顾里看趋势。": "No focus habit yet: finished sessions go to one created automatically, visible in Review.", "这个浏览器不支持桌面通知": "This browser does not support desktop notifications", "长休息": "Long break"
