  "云盘同步文件夹": "Cloud-drive sync folder",
  "Google Drive / Dropbox / OneDrive / iCloud Drive 的电脑客户端都有一个同步文件夹，选它就等于备份上了那家云盘；也可以选电脑上任何位置。只留 {n} 天。": "Google Drive / Dropbox / OneDrive / iCloud Drive desktop apps each keep a sync folder; choosing it puts the backup on that cloud. Any folder on this computer works too. Kept {n} days.",
  "应用自己的云端": "The app's own cloud",
  "这个家庭在共用的 Supabase 项目里的存储，全家任何设备都能恢复；只留 {n} 天；需要先执行迁移 017。": "This family's storage in the shared Supabase project; any device can restore; kept {n} days; needs migration 017 first.",
