  "看看我最近 7 天的读经和祷告情况，先说说做得好的地方，再给我下周可以怎么更稳定地坚持的一两个小建议。": "Look at my Bible reading and prayer over the last 7 days. Start with what went well, then give me one or two small suggestions for keeping it steadier next week.",
  "根据我最近 7 天的锻炼、饮食、睡眠和屏幕时长，哪一项最值得先调整？给我一个下周就能做到的小目标。": "Based on my exercise, diet, sleep and screen time over the last 7 days, which one is worth adjusting first? Give me one small goal I can reach next week.",
  "下面是我的任务和专注计时情况。帮我看看明天怎么安排：哪些该先做，哪些可以放下或顺延？": "Below are my tasks and focus sessions. Help me plan tomorrow: what should come first, and what can be dropped or postponed?",
