  "还没填 API key：把问题连同记录摘要拼成提示词，复制到任一 AI 粘贴即可；填了 key（免费的 Gemini 就行）就能在这里直接出答案。": "No API key yet: your question plus the summary becomes a prompt you can copy into any AI. Add a key (free Gemini works) to get answers right here.",
